tes Census (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAxMF9Vbml0ZWRfU3RhdGVzX0NlbnN1cz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">2010</span></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"navbox-abovebelow\" colspan=\"2\"><div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"United States Census Bureau (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVW5pdGVkX1N0YXRlc19DZW5zdXNfQnVyZWF1P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">U.S. Census Bureau</span></li>\n<li>USDA <span class=\"new\" title=\"Census of Agriculture (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2Vuc3VzX29mX0FncmljdWx0dXJlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Census of Agriculture</span></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>How to manage this template's initial visibility</b><br />\nTo manage this template's visibility when it first appears, <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Template\" title=\"Help:Template\">add the parameter</a>:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><code class=\"nowrap\">&#124;state&#61;collapsed</code> to show the template in its collapsed state, i.e. hidden apart from its titlebar&#160;– e.g. <code>{{USCensus |state=collapsed}}</code></dd>\n<dd><code class=\"nowrap\">&#124;state&#61;expanded</code> to show the template in its expanded state, i.e. fully visible&#160;– e.g. <code>{{USCensus |state=expanded}}</code></dd>\n<dd><code class=\"nowrap\">&#124;state&#61;autocollapse</code> to show the template in its collapsed state <i>but only if</i> there is another template of the same type on the page&#160;– e.g. <code>{{USCensus |state=autocollapse}}</code></dd></dl>\n<p>Unless set otherwise (see the <code class=\"nowrap\">&#124;state&#61;</code> parameter in the template's code), the template's default state is <code>autocollapse</code>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205505\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal tim